      "text": "Norse mythology is the pre-Christian religion of the Germanic peoples of Scandinavia. Its primary sources are two Icelandic texts from ~1220 CE: the **Prose Edda** (Snorri Sturluson) and the **Poetic Edda** (anonymous compilation). Both were written by Christians 200+ years after Norway/Iceland converted (~1000 CE), which colors their content."
